{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026aQ7ALmkFcy1793294057.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞冠二級聯賽，大埔主場輸巴吞聯三球。</p><p></p><p>白衫大埔上半場連失三球，比蒙迪撞射入網，令謝家榮28分鐘，第一次失守，大埔落後0-1。</p><p></p><p>4分鐘後，曉高拉馬處理罰球，門前彈地後直接入網，為巴吞聯拉開2-0。這支泰超球隊，頭兩輪一和一負。臨完半場再由拉達薩，接應直線射入，42分鐘贏到三球，成為全場比數。</p><p></p><p>大埔輸0-3，於F組三連敗兼零入球，0分包尾，巴吞聯以4分排第三，下星期次循環，大埔作客與對方再鬥過。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T18:00:38.254287+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T16:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:58:34.072464+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T17:58:18.884317+00:00","content_hash":"fb5716708ccc61a6488c23f825dd647ac58d5015903a1ded04b84d3cae807fb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}